    "Verrou can check your passwords with Have I Been Pwned. Only the first 5 characters of their SHA-1 hash go out: neither the passwords nor their full hash leave this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou peut vérifier vos mots de passe auprès de Have I Been Pwned. Seuls les 5 premiers caractères de leur empreinte SHA-1 partent : ni les mots de passe, ni leur empreinte complète ne quittent ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou kann deine Passwörter mit Have I Been Pwned prüfen. Nur die ersten 5 Zeichen ihres SHA-1-Hashs werden gesendet: Weder die Passwörter noch ihr vollständiger Hash verlassen diesen Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou puede comprobar tus contraseñas con Have I Been Pwned. Solo salen los 5 primeros caracteres de su hash SHA-1: ni las contraseñas ni su hash completo salen de este Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou può controllare le tue password con Have I Been Pwned. Escono solo i primi 5 caratteri del loro hash SHA-1: né le password né il loro hash completo lasciano questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verrou can't copy the link: Vaultwarden only gives it to the invited person's email.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou ne peut pas copier le lien : Vaultwarden ne le donne qu'à l'e-mail de la personne invitée."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou kann den Link nicht kopieren: Vaultwarden gibt ihn nur an die E-Mail-Adresse der eingeladenen Person."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou no puede copiar el enlace: Vaultwarden solo lo envía al correo electrónico de la persona invitada."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou non può copiare il link: Vaultwarden lo fornisce solo all'email della persona invitata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verrou fills your logins, codes and passkeys in Safari and the Mac's apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verrou remplit vos identifiants, codes et passkeys dans Safari et les apps du Mac."
